888">'s </span><span begin="01:13.888" end="01:13.985">feeling </span><span begin="01:13.985" end="01:14.082">right </span><span begin="01:14.082" end="01:14.179">（</span><span begin="01:14.179" end="01:14.276">Scream</span><span begin="01:14.276" end="01:14.390">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.390" end="01:16.610"><span begin="01:14.390" end="01:14.506">Scream</span><span begin="01:14.506" end="01:14.622">, </span><span begin="01:14.622" end="01:14.738">at </span><span begin="01:14.738" end="01:14.854">the </span><span begin="01:14.854" end="01:14.970">top </span><span begin="01:14.970" end="01:15.086">of </span><span begin="01:15.086" end="01:15.202">your </span><span begin="01:15.202" end="01:15.318">lungs</span><span begin="01:15.318" end="01:15.434">, </span><span begin="01:15.434" end="01:15.550">if </span><span begin="01:15.550" end="01:15.666">your </span><span begin="01:15.666" end="01:15.782">body</span><span begin="01:15.782" end="01:15.898">\</span><span begin="01:15.898" end="01:16.014">'s </span><span begin="01:16.014" end="01:16.130">feeling </span><span begin="01:16.130" end="01:16.246">right </span><span begin="01:16.246" end="01:16.362">（</span><span begin="01:16.362" end="01:16.478">Oh</span><span begin="01:16.478" end="01:16.610">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.610" end="01:26.450"><span begin="01:16.610" end="01:17.750">Scream</span><span begin="01:17.750" end="01:17.750">, </span><span begin="01:17.750" end="01:17.900">at </span><span begin="01:17.900" end="01:17.990">the </span><span begin="01:17.990" end="01:18.410">top </span><span begin="01:18.410" end="01:18.680">of </span><span begin="01:18.680" end="01:18.770">your </span><span begin="01:18.770" end="01:19.580">lungs</span><span begin="01:19.580" end="01:19.580">, </span><span begin="01:19.580" end="01:19.700">if </span><span begin="01:19.700" end="01:19.940">your </span><span begin="01:19.940" end="01:20.330">body</span><span begin="01:20.330" end="01:20.360">\</sp